 research program of the California Institute for Machine Consciousness (CIMC) and the theoretical commitments that guide our work.","body_html":"<p></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5GOH!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffaba6757-a791-44a0-b8c4-49e0b42041bb_2876x954.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5GOH!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffaba6757-a791-44a0-b8c4-49e0b42041bb_2876x954.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5GOH!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffaba6757-a791-44a0-b8c4-49e0b42041bb_2876x954.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5GOH!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffaba6757-a791-44a0-b8c4-49e0b42041bb_2876x954.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5GOH!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffaba6757-a791-44a0-b8c4-49e0b42041bb_2876x954.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5GOH!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffaba6757-a791-44a0-b8c4-49e0b42041bb_2876x954.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"483\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/faba6757-a791-44a0-b8c4-49e0b42041bb_2876x954.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:483,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:231771,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://cimcai.substack.com/i/169146691?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffaba6757-a791-44a0-b8c4-49e0b42041bb_2876x954.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5GOH!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffaba6757-a791-44a0-b8c4-49e0b42041bb_2876x954.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5GOH!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffaba6757-a791-44a0-b8c4-49e0b42041bb_2876x954.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5GOH!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffaba6757-a791-44a0-b8c4-49e0b42041bb_2876x954.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5GOH!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffaba6757-a791-44a0-b8c4-49e0b42041bb_2876x954.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Our foundational white paper lays out the research program of the California Institute for Machine Consciousness (CIMC) and the theoretical commitments that guide our work.</p><p>The paper addresses a question that has moved from philosophical speculation to practical urgency: under what conditions could artificial systems be conscious, and how would we know if they were? </p><p>Rather than approaching this as a purely conceptual debate or a matter of surface behavior, the white paper argues for a constructive scientific approach: treating consciousness as something to be formally characterized, implemented, and tested.</p><p>The document is built on what we call the <a href=\"https://cimc.ai/cimcHypothesis.pdf\">Machine Consciousness Hypothesis</a>, our computationalist functionalist research framework. It proposes a specific account of consciousness as a functional pattern involving coherence maximization, second-order perception, and self-organizing developmental dynamics, and outlines how such hypotheses can be evaluated through building and analyzing artificial systems rather than relying on behavioral proxies alone.</p><p>Beyond theory, the paper lays out CIMC’s research agenda: the kinds of architectures we are exploring, the empirical signatures we think matter, the limitations of current approaches (including large language models), and the ethical implications of creating systems whose consciousness status may be uncertain.</p><p>This white paper is intended as both a statement of position and an invitation—to researchers, critics, and collaborators—to engage with a research program that treats consciousness as a tractable scientific challenge.</p><p></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://cimc.ai/cimcWhitepaper.pdf&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Full White Paper&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://cimc.ai/cimcWhitepaper.pdf\"><span>Full White Paper</span></a></p><p></p><div><hr></div><h2><strong>Engage With Us</strong></h2><p><strong>→ CIMC is recruiting researcher engineers </strong><br><a href=\"https://app.dover.com/apply/California%20Institute%20for%20Machine%20Consciousness/61d91655-4dd4-42a1-b0b5-0e0f48100ade/?rs=76643084\">Apply here </a></p><p><strong>→ Submit a Research Proposal</strong><br><a href=\"https://cimc.ai/#/proposals\">All info here</a></p><p><strong>→ Collaborate or Fund<br></strong>If you’re interested in supporting or partnering with us, email: <a href=\"http://proposals@cimc.ai/\">proposals@cimc.ai</a></p><p><strong>→ Join our Machine Consciousness Salons</strong><br>Regularly hosted in San Francisco: <a href=\"https://lu.ma/cimc\">Luma</a> calendar</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://cimc.ai/&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Visit CIMC's Website&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:&quot;button-wrapper&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary button-wrapper\" href=\"https://cimc.ai/\"><span>Visit CIMC's Website</span></a></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/CIMCAI&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Follow CIMC on X&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:&quot;button-wrapper&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary button-wrapper\" href=\"https://x.com/CIMCAI\"><span>Follow CIMC on X</span></a></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/cimc-ai/&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Follow CIMC on LinkedIn&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:&quot;button-wrapper&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary button-wrapper\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/cimc-ai/\"><span>Follow CIMC on LinkedIn</span></a></p><div><hr></div><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://cimcai.substack.com/p/the-beginning-of-the-california-institute?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share&amp;token=eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjozMjAzNDUwODksInBvc3RfaWQiOjE2NjA5MTExNSwiaWF0IjoxNzUzMzcxNDA4LCJleHAiOjE3NTU5NjM0MDgsImlzcyI6InB1Yi00ODY0ODc0Iiwic3ViIjoicG9zdC1yZWFjdGlvbiJ9.XFp_tl5fqZ44xJWCzxilHL0lrNhJ9qnE8nE0Wd4lszY&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\"><em>Thanks for reading our CIMC publication! Feel free to forward this to anyone who muses over the inner minds of systems</em></p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://cimcai.substack.com/p/foundational-white-paper?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://cimcai.substack.com/p/foundational-white-paper?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p></div><div data-component-name=\"FragmentNodeToDOM\"><p></p></div>","has_dynamic_content":false,"truncated_body_text":"Our foundational white paper lays out the research program of the California Institute for Machine Consciousness (CIMC) and the theoretical commitments that guide our work.","wordcount":292,"post_preview_limit":null,"language":"en","postTags":[],"postCountryBlocks":[],"disable_drop_cap":false,"cover_image_crop":null,"headlineTest":null,"coverImagePalette":{"Vibrant":{"rgb":[127.5,127.5,127.5],"population":0},"DarkVibrant":{"rgb":[66.3,66.3,66.3],"population":0},"LightVibrant":{"rgb":[188.7,188.7,188.7],"population":0},"Muted":{"rgb":[128,128,128],"population":12},"DarkMuted":{"rgb":[72,72,72],"population":20},"LightMuted":{"rgb":[180,180,180],"population":1165}},"publishedBylines":[{"id":320345089,"name":"CIMC","handle":"cimcai","photo_url":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/49655144-0879-47b1-a82a-3e194101f64f_1494x1494.png","bio":"The CIMC is building a community that conducts experimental research by formulating testable theories of consciousness, running simulations, and building artifacts that advance our understanding of the mind.","profile_set_up_at":"2025-04-29T12:14:27.352Z","reader_installed_at":"2026-04-13T11:09:51.806Z","publicationUsers":[{"id":4962076,"user_id":320345089,"publication_id":4864874,"role":"admin","public":true,"is_primary":true,"publication":{"id":4864874,"name":"CIMC Publication","subdomain":"cimcai","custom_domain":null,"custom_domain_optional":false,"hero_text":"Welcome to my publication","logo_url":null,"author_id":320345089,"primary_user_id":320345089,"theme_var_background_pop":"#FF6719","created_at":"2025-04-29T12:15:14.167Z","email_from_name":null,"copyright":"CIMC","founding_plan_name":null,"community_enabled":true,"invite_only":false,"payments_state":"disabled","language":null,"explicit":false,"homepage_type":"newspaper","is_personal_mode":false,"logo_url_wide":null}}],"is_guest":false,"bestseller_tier":null,"status":{"bestsellerTier":null,"subscriberTier":null,"leaderboard":null,"vip":false,"badge":null,"subscriber":null}}],"reaction":null,"reaction_count":26,"comment_count":2,"child_comment_count":2,"audio_items":[{"post_id":186077336,"voice_id":"en-GB-AdaMultilingualNeural","audio_url":"https://substack-video.s3.amazonaws.com/video_upload/post/186077336/tts/b5397e24-1931-4cd5-ad45-18ade90cffd2/en-GB-AdaMultilingualNeural.mp3","type":"tts","status":"completed"}],"vg_wort_pixel_url":null,"is_geoblocked":false,"sponsorshipEditionBanner":null,"is_editor_preview":false,"hasCashtag":false,"unlockedWithIP":false,"unlockedWithCampaign":false,"themeVariables":{"color_theme_bg_pop":"#FF6719","background_pop":"#FF6719","color_theme_bg_web":null,"cover_bg_color":"#FFFFFF","cover_bg_color_secondary":"#f0f0f0","background_pop_darken":"#ff5600","print_on_pop":"#ffffff","color_theme_bg_pop_darken":"#ff5600","color_theme_print_on_pop":"#ffffff","color_theme_bg_pop_20":"rgba(255, 103, 25, 0.2)","color_theme_bg_pop_30":"rgba(255, 103, 25, 0.3)","print_pop":"#ff6719","color_theme_accent":"#ff6719","cover_print_primary":"#363737","cover_print_secondary":"#757575","cover_print_tertiary":"#b6b6b6","cover_border_color":"#ff6719","home_hero":"newspaper","home_posts":"list","background_contrast_1":"#f0f0f0","background_contrast_2":"#dddddd","background_contrast_3":"#b7b7b7","background_contrast_4":"#929292","background_contrast_5":"#515151","color_theme_detail":"#e6e6e6","background_contrast_pop":"rgba(255, 103, 25, 0.4)","color_theme_bg_contrast_pop":"rgba(255, 103, 25, 0.4)","theme_bg_is_dark":"0","background_pop_rgb":"255, 103, 25","color_theme_bg_pop_rgb":"255, 103, 25","color_theme_accent_rgb":"255, 103, 25"},"comments":[{"id":276066845,"body":"Glad I found CIMC, and I look forward to seeing more from your work.\n\nIn my opinion, this paper touches on so many foundational issues that more people need to be discussing, debating, and building consensus around human-machine relationships, our similarities, and our distinct differences.\n\nYour paper is particularly valuable because it starts the conversation as broadly and inclusively as possible.\n\nIf this were a working-group discussion, I would first commend the broad inclusivity of concepts, but then argue for greater refinement through distinct definitions and categories of claims. Why?\n\nBecause studying consciousness by testing intelligence is like studying whether the heart pumps blood by measuring whether a person can solve math problems. Both belong to the same organism, but they are not the same function. Intelligence may use consciousness, consciousness may support intelligence, and both may interact with agency, but evidence for one is not automatically evidence for the other.\n\nIt seems that each of these constructs should be treated and studied separately if the goal is to establish a rigorous and durable body of scholarship.\n\nKeep up the good work.","body_json":{"type":"doc","attrs":{"schemaVersion":"v1","title":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Glad I found CIMC, and I look forward to seeing more from your work."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"In my opinion, this paper touches on so many foundational issues that more people need to be discussing, debating, and building consensus around human-machine relationships, our similarities, and our distinct differences."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Your paper is particularly valuable because it starts the conversation as broadly and inclusively as possible."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"If this were a working-group discussion, I would first commend the broad inclusivity of concepts, but then argue for greater refinement through distinct definitions and categories of claims. Why?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Because studying consciousness by testing intelligence is like studying whether the heart pumps blood by measuring whether a person can solve math problems. Both belong to the same organism, but they are not the same function. Intelligence may use consciousness, consciousness may support intelligence, and both may interact with agency, but evidence for one is not automatically evidence for the other."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"It seems that each of these constructs should be treated and studied separately if the goal is to establish a rigorous and durable body of scholarship."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Keep up the good work."}]}]},"publication_id":4864874,"post_id":186077336,"user_id":47121833,"ancestor_path":"","type":"comment","deleted":false,"date":"2026-06-14T11:52:40.256Z","edited_at":null,"status":"published","pinned_by_user_id":null,"restacks":0,"name":"Felipe A. Zubia","photo_url":"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/580707b9-9912-4a5a-b923-1a45b4e239fa_1136x1136.jpeg","handle":"fezubia","reactor_names":[],"reaction":null,"reactions":{"❤":0},"reaction_count":0,"children":[],"bans":[],"suppressed":false,"user_banned":false,"user_banned_for_comment":false,"user_slug":"fezubia","metadata":{"is_author":false,"membership_state":"free_signup","eligibleForGift":false,"author_on_other_pub":{"name":"Felipe A. Zubia","id":4183178,"base_url":"https://fezubia.substack.com"}},"user_bestseller_tier":null,"can_dm":true,"userStatus":{"bestsellerTier":null,"subscriberTier":5,"leaderboard":null,"vip":false,"badge":{"type":"subscriber","tier":5,"accent_colors":null},"subscriber":null},"score":1,"children_count":0,"reported_by_user":false,"restacked":false},{"id":208208934,"body":"Possible typo in the Full White Paper: section 4.5.2, page 17 , “ … that 